     3371        FI_parts_VAT-pc AT ROW 21.54 COL 18 COLON-ALIGNED
     3372        FI_parts_SLT-type AT ROW 21.54 COL 37.5 COLON-ALIGNED
     3373        FI_parts_SLT-pc AT ROW 21.54 COL 51.5 COLON-ALIGNED
     3374        FI_country-name AT ROW 21.92 COL 73 COLON-ALIGNED
     3375        FI_purch-code AT ROW 22.83 COL 18 COLON-ALIGNED
