     4273   ON CHOOSE OF b-quit IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     4274   DO:
     4275   define variable vss-include-info38 as character format "X(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     4276   if lookup(self :type
     4277            ,'BROWSE,FILL-IN,FRAME,BUTTON,RADIO-SET,COMBO-BOX,SELECTION-LIST,CONTROL-FRAME,SLIDER,DIALOG-BOX,TOGGLE-BOX,EDITOR,WINDOW'
     4278            ) = 0
     4279   then do:
